{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f70b78007830625f7e89dd77fd6d36199e9277d1866b5e9dd86cc5fb837d48d", "ja": "（仕事の台本を渡そうと思って海美に連絡したら、\n今から劇場へ来てもらうことになった……）", "zh": "（本想把工作的剧本交给海美，联系她后，她说要我现在去剧场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "80bef61199917acf78a0f2a6497a759245136f3c1199867dab25396dbeb4bb66", "ja": "お疲れ様、{$P$}！\n台本、取りに来たよ～。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n我来拿剧本啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1002_p", "source_sha256": "31457282ea1d9624394a601a0a8fada0619614910697e82318fbbdd21d6507c3", "ja": "お疲れ様、海美。悪かったな。\nオフなのに、取りに来てもらっちゃって……。", "zh": "辛苦了，海美。真不好意思。\n明明是休息日，还让你特意过来取……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "34b2e1a2b948d6f20fefab55ef91dcc80e52ec146b36fa593cb469761858358d", "ja": "ううん、全然！\n今日は出かける予定だったから、ちょうど良かった！", "zh": "没事的，完全不要紧！\n今天本来就打算出门，正好顺路！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4dc48406f1b0b4db155b77b94a3ef546d22e3b742803f06e45d4175d43628c36", "ja": "そうか。……いわれてみれば、確かに。\n随分おめかししてるけど、どこに行くんだ？", "zh": "这样啊……仔细一想，确实是。\n你打扮得真漂亮，这是要去哪儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "18d062999eae39b7853aa591578bd1a0801d04bc64f63c0cd278685176a9d22b", "ja": "実は……お姉ちゃんが日本に帰ってくるの！\nだから、家族みんなでご飯に行くんだ！", "zh": "其实……我姐姐要回日本了！\n所以，全家人要一起去吃顿饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "41c600284d3b6eac4f8c15f61df14ebaa1f56e06ee08670bc7179733289aab1e", "ja": "お姉ちゃんに会うのも楽しみだけど、久しぶりに\n家族全員そろってのご飯だから、そっちも楽しみ～！", "zh": "虽然也很期待见到姐姐，但毕竟是久违地全家一起吃饭，那个也让我很期待～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1b1ea579c49e28c22822b11b31428d70a0e8610dc647418ceaef03632c7b9f75", "ja": "なるほど、家族水入らずってわけだな。\nお姉さんとたくさん話せるといいな。", "zh": "原来如此，是难得一家人团聚的时间啊。\n希望你能和姐姐好好聊聊天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "4817041c143f5d91d6c662db7001d5ba25d06e90ad816789d085d01d5d9cc472", "ja": "うん！　お姉ちゃんに成長したとこ見せたくて、\n今日は一生懸命オシャレしちゃった。えへへ♪", "zh": "嗯！我想让姐姐看看我的成长，所以今天特意努力打扮了一番。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "029197edd5ec2862c661b54cb3ed7684adff4330634d3bf23b6fef62eb01156d", "ja": "そうだ！　このあとのご飯、\n{$P$}も一緒に行かない？", "zh": "对了！待会儿吃饭，{$P$}也一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1fa5e0224ffe444668e87697ea3a7821de76bfc8e7eea6794114120462f5e8da", "ja": "えっ！？　せっかく家族水入らずなのに、\n俺が行ったら、お邪魔じゃないか？", "zh": "诶！？难得是家人团聚，我要是去了，不会打扰你们吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "a84df3d0ca1dfc6e5b2ca12163b570ddc6cf55ad96d39a21d6fdd73498c9d133", "ja": "大丈夫！　{$P$}と話してみたい\nって、家族みんな言ってるし！", "zh": "没事的！家里人全都说，\n想和{$P$}聊聊看呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0673b8825e3065f38d9aa4343ad2ff1159afd18268d5c598a351bfe7a992f511", "ja": "そうなのか？　確かに、海美のご家族とは、\nちゃんと話したことはなかったな……。", "zh": "是这样吗？确实还没好好和海美的家人聊过呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "de2fdbcc4a7fe63b1119fa6ff77280f8ef0d6c6f31f018d6bea19e468be59601", "ja": "でしょ～？　お父さん達にちゃんと紹介するから！\nこの人が私のプロデューサーだよ、って……あれ？", "zh": "对吧～？我会好好把你介绍给爸爸他们的！说“这位就是我的制作人”……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "0da0cecfa4b9b4076ee1d7ba4ad140ed53b7eb103d5c4321b8e05d4efc473cae", "ja": "あっ……えーっと、ごめん！　やっぱり今のナシ！\nご飯は、また今度でもいいかな……？", "zh": "啊……那个，对不起！刚才的话还是算了！\n吃饭的事，改天再说可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b60bf4450e03fdfa7c228ea89d79ee7a14c37bc97170b25f2d08008d6db49567", "ja": "ん？　ああ、大丈夫だよ。どのみち、\n予定を確認してから、返事をしようと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "嗯？啊，没关系的。反正我本来就打算确认日程后再回复。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "d5a551a39116f26e3c4059bdfd26105a69e644407211f861b963b8d04f289ce9", "ja": "そ、そっか！　ごめんね、変なこと言って。\nよく考えたら、今日の主役はお姉ちゃんなんだよね。", "zh": "这、这样啊！对不起，说了奇怪的话。\n仔细想想，今天的主角是姐姐才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "eaa30dc33c4787417aa27ee0113fe645774131f6ebd9f81b62a2a576846b2cc5", "ja": "だから、{$P$}がいたら……\nきっと家族にとられちゃう……。", "zh": "所以，要是有{$P$}在的话……\n肯定会被家人抢走的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1018_p", "source_sha256": "83bb7125b775c0826264f947e5267f5a44a0b026168b25e891100c189c15c2a9", "ja": "とられるって、お姉さんを？", "zh": "你说的被抢走，是指姐姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "3a584d248cb8e728dce5912bbda54cbd663b2d21fd6bda572d753c1b129c54f3", "ja": "えっ！？　あ、そうじゃなくて！　えーと……\n{$P$}も、お姉ちゃんもどっちも！", "zh": "诶！？啊，不是那个意思！呃……  \n{$P$}也好，姐姐也好，我都想要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "9f26838942ea346968b1cf18c3d8a3b05d9fc7ca7107b4acdeb2f663ac5c728d", "ja": "私だって、お姉ちゃんとお話したいし、\n{$P$}ともお話したいもん！", "zh": "我也想和姐姐聊天，\n也想和{$P$}聊天嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a1657d5664e25e9cf6289606750d5502b369a69223a7e013e702b543085db420", "ja": "ははっ、そうか！　じゃあ海美と話す時間は\n改めて作ろう。今日のところは家族で楽しんでおいで。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊！那就改天再专门安排时间和海美聊聊吧。今天就和家人好好玩吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "b6ec140e34310587e614e94657830b3050cabfdb27ad55d3720f4fd8dc9b3d99", "ja": "うん！　家族を紹介するのは、また今度。\nその時は連絡するから、一緒に予定考えようね♪", "zh": "嗯！介绍家人还是下次吧。\n到时候我会联系你的，我们一起想想安排吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0364_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0364_1023_p", "source_sha256": "dc124117b8b333478cd65b9f2e7022eaa82c0a14eb69abfcf0193b083c9b0d59", "ja": "（海美にとって、家族と過ごす時間は大事なんだな。\n久しぶりの家族水入らず、楽しんできてほしいな！）", "zh": "（对海美来说，和家人共度的时光很重要啊。\n难得和家人好好团聚一次，希望她能玩得开心！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
